# ================================================================
# .gitignore
# ----------------------------------------------------------------
# PURPOSE : Keep things that must NEVER reach the PUBLIC GitHub repo out of it.
#
# CHANGE LOG
# - 2026-10-13 : Initial version.
#     * .env / *.secret : the Job app's client secret lives ONLY in GitHub
#       Secrets (and a local .env for testing) - never in the repo.
#     * *.xlsx / *.xls / samples/ : real trackers contain staff names and
#       project data; a public repo must not hold them.
#     * node_modules : installed from package.json, never committed.
# - 2026-10-14 : ADDED "!.env.example" - the ".env.*" rule also blocked the
#       settings TEMPLATE (no secret in it), which belongs in the repo.
#     * ADDED config-samples/ - it holds real staff email addresses
#       (trackers.json for the test tracker); the repo is PUBLIC.
#     * ADDED .vs/ - Visual Studio's local cache / settings folder.
# ================================================================

# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Secrets - NEVER commit
.env
.env.*
*.secret
*.pfx
*.pem
!.env.example

# Real tracker files / test data (staff names, project data)
*.xlsx
*.xlsm
*.xls
samples/
config-samples/

# Output of local test runs
out/
*.log

# Editor / OS
.vscode/
.vs/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
